# Build context exclusions. Anything the image does not need stays out, so the
# context stays small and changing it never invalidates a build layer.
#
# `.env.development` is excluded through the `.env.*` pattern on purpose: the
# image never carries dev configuration. The build gets the throwaway values it
# needs for module evaluation from the Dockerfile itself, and the real values
# arrive at runtime from the orchestrator.
node_modules
.next
out
.env
.env.*
data
docs
